  "prefLabel": "Pos 1501.03 Approved CART and Sign Language Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pos 1501.03 Approved CART and Sign Language Certification.\n\n(a) CART providers shall have current certification as a “Certified CART Provider (CCP)”, as provided by the national court reporters association (NCRA).\n\n(b) Sign language interpreters shall be:\n\n(1) Licensed by the board of licensure of interpreters for the deaf and hard of hearing under RSA 326-I; or\n\n(2) Certified by NH department of education as an educational interpreter.\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pos100-1700.html"
}
